 "name_en": "General Ledger Allocation Cycle (1GI)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>General Ledger Allocation Cycle (1GI)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7d7890b40ee44c36ad361c7bf160e022\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7d7890b40ee44c36ad361c7bf160e022__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Prior to the allocation process at period end of profit centers or segments that cannot be allocated, shared costs are accumulated during the period on those profit centers or segments. These costs must be allocated on predetermined criteria to allocable segments, or the reposting of the profit center for adjustment. You distribute the costs from profit centers (assigned to segments that cannot be allocated) to profit center assigned to allocable segment under original general ledger accounts. The distribution cycles must be configured.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7d7890b40ee44c36ad361c7bf160e022__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Change Actual Distribution Cycle G/L</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Actual Distribution Cycle G/L</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Delete Actual Distribution Cycle G/L</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display Actual Distribution Cycle G/L</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute Actual Distribution G/L</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Overview Actual Distribution G/L</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7d7890b40ee44c36ad361c7bf160e022__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform distribution during the period-end closing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>总账分配周期 (1GI)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7d7890b40ee44c36ad361c7bf160e022\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7d7890b40ee44c36ad361c7bf160e022__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在无法分配的利润中心或段的期末分配流程之前，共享成本在这些利润中心或段的期间内累计。这些成本必须根据预先确定的标准分配到可分配段，或重新过账利润中心以进行调整。将成本从利润中心（分配到无法分配的段）分配到原始总账科目下分配到可分配段的利润中心。必须配置分配周期。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7d7890b40ee44c36ad361c7bf160e022__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">更改实际分配周期总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建实际分配周期总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">删除实际分配周期总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示实际分配周期总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行实际分配总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">概览实际分配总账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7d7890b40ee44c36ad361c7bf160e022__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在期末关账期间执行分配</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
